                             "Gross margin stalls near 40% as the lower-margin transceiver mix grows.",
                             "The PhotonLink customer is unnamed, which adds execution and concentration risk before revenue starts in 2028.",
                             "US-China trade and FCC rules change supply chains or customer demand in unexpected ways."
                         ]
